{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1194144-looking-for-some-ideas-help-new-to-mage-the-awakening","id":1194144,"title":"Looking for Some Ideas/Help (New to Mage the Awakening)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-10T23:03:49-08:00","id":1194144,"title":"Looking for Some Ideas/Help (New to Mage the Awakening)","content":"<span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I'm thinking of running Mage the Awakening for the very first time. I own every book and I'm using my own homebrew city setting.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I'm looking for ideas and advice if possible. It's a 2 player game with players who are also new to the game.<br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">What's the best way to set up the start of the chronicle?<br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Any advice on character creation? <br /> Any things to avoid?</span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">I'm sure you get the idea...<br /> </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">1 character concept is a party girl who is a little to close to the sex drugs and rock and roll scene. The other is a hedge fund manager who lives for extreme sports and adrenalin rushes.</span><br /> </span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6295-dargurd","name":"Dargurd","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T05:26:22-07:00","id":1194218,"title":"","content":"Have you read the Storytelling section?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T06:45:25-07:00","id":1194230,"title":"","content":"The two character concepts look like people who will be very quickly addicted to magic, both the opportunities it opens up and magic itself. So maybe run with that as a theme? Give them the good stuff at the beginning, and let the consequences come crashing down later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T06:50:06-07:00","id":1194232,"title":"","content":"I'm going to link a thread from another Forum, that you'll probably find useful:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?815371-Mage-the-Awakening-2e-Seeking-Advice-Running-Mage-for-the-First-Time\" target=\"_blank\">[Mage: the Awakening 2e] Seeking Advice - Running Mage for the First Time</a><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T09:27:44-07:00","id":1194272,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1194144-looking-for-some-ideas-help-new-to-mage-the-awakening?p=1194230#post1194230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The two character concepts look like people who will be very quickly addicted to magic, both the opportunities it opens up and magic itself. So maybe run with that as a theme? Give them the good stuff at the beginning, and let the consequences come crashing down later.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Lol love the idea of things crashing down - thankyou so much, very much appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6295-dargurd","name":"Dargurd","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T09:28:45-07:00","id":1194273,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1194144-looking-for-some-ideas-help-new-to-mage-the-awakening?p=1194232#post1194232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm going to link a thread from another Forum, that you'll probably find useful:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?815371-Mage-the-Awakening-2e-Seeking-Advice-Running-Mage-for-the-First-Time\" target=\"_blank\">[Mage: the Awakening 2e] Seeking Advice - Running Mage for the First Time</a><br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thankyou - really appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6295-dargurd","name":"Dargurd","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T09:29:43-07:00","id":1194275,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1194144-looking-for-some-ideas-help-new-to-mage-the-awakening?p=1194218#post1194218\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have you read the Storytelling section?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hiya - yes i have. Im guess im just asking for more &quot;personal&quot; advice from other storytellers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6295-dargurd","name":"Dargurd","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T19:28:46-07:00","id":1194419,"title":"","content":"Personally I like to link the character's first obsession, and if possible the first mystery/plot of the chronicle, to their Awakening.<br /> Examples using the described characters:<br /> \u200b1-She was a party girl, went to all the edgy clubs and exclusive parties and as she did she started to recognize a pattern that didn't make sense to her experience, people who didn't look like they belonged yet who had the run of the place, guys who shouldn't warrant the time of day would walk up to a pretty girl and with just a few whispered words would leave with her, people who became the life of the party and yet afterwards she couldn't remember what was so special about them, true nightmares on legs that the bouncers (real arm breakers) wouldn't even look at. It was like there was an inner circle, a secret elite that could not be denied. She decided, perhaps unwisely, to find out what was really going on so the next time she saw one of these people she pushed her way into their entourage. She approached one of those guys and he left her for dead in an alley. She woke up anemic in the hospital and a Moros. She sees things differently now and she is going to find out what's going on, especially with the guy who tried to kill her.<br /> Obsession: Vampires.<br /> <br /> \u200b2-He had a high pressure job, the fortunes of important people were often dependent upon his decisions, so he and a buddy/coworker started chasing extreme sports to burn of stress. At first it was mountain biking, then rock climbing followed by jumping out of perfectly good airplanes, but then his buddy started pushing him to try riskier adventures. In no time his buddy didn't have to push him as it was like an irresistible urge was driving him to push the envelope further and further until friends and family were trying to hold him back. They failed. It all ended when he went to a bar in the wrong part of town and intentionally picked a fight with the most dangerous guy he could find. As he lay there bleeding out on the floor, just before the paramedics arrived, he saw a grinning, manic figure standing over him that didn't seem right, didn't seem quite human and just before he passed out from shock and blood loss somehow he felt he knew them. He woke up in the ambulance a Thrysus. The next time he saw his buddy again he could see that his friend didn't look healthy, and he caught glimpses of that same manic figure watching in the background.<br /> Obsession: Spirits.<br /> <br /> \u200bNow if you can just figure out a plot that appeals to both obsessions you pull the characters and hopefully their players head first into your plot. They start out invested in events and aren't asking why they should get involved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6084,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","user":"2ptTakrill","date":". 03-11-2018, 10:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T21:36:52-07:00","id":1194732,"title":"","content":"Thankyou for this. This is absolutely superb. Some really good stuff here and im definately going to use it with only minor tweaks. Thanks again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6295-dargurd","name":"Dargurd","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T07:52:27-07:00","id":1196052,"title":"","content":"Alternatively, given that they are both thrill junkies, perhaps they meet and Awaken at the same event? A party gone wrong (or right, depending on your outlook). It also seems like they might fit well with the Mastigos - the Devil seems to fit their current nature, and Temperance seems to fit the arc of Consequences That Come Crashing Down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T12:35:50-07:00","id":1196171,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1194144-looking-for-some-ideas-help-new-to-mage-the-awakening?p=1196052#post1196052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alternatively, given that they are both thrill junkies, perhaps they meet and Awaken at the same event? A party gone wrong (or right, depending on your outlook). It also seems like they might fit well with the Mastigos - the Devil seems to fit their current nature, and Temperance seems to fit the arc of Consequences That Come Crashing Down.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Like this idea - consider it stolen :-) One of them is going Mastigos so this could fit quite nicely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6295-dargurd","name":"Dargurd","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}